{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-altitude-de-grisogono","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"altitude-de-grisogono","about":"Elevate your living standards at Damac Altitude de Grisogono, a symbol of Dubai's architectural innovation. This radiant high-rise not only aligns with the city's glittering skyline but also stands as an invitation to a life beyond the ordinary at Altitude de Grisogono.Embrace the harmonious blend of tranquil waterfront vibes and bustling city life in Damac Business Bay.  Altitude de Grisogono apartments offer panoramic views that span the dynamic Dubai skyline and serene Dubai Canal, crafting a living experience unlike any other. Within the 38-story Damac Altitude tower, a diverse array of residential choices awaits, including sophisticated studios and 1 to 3 bedroom apartments and 2 bedroom duplexes.Situated at the nexus of new Dubai, the Altitude de Grisogono by Damac boasts a prestigious location in Business Bay. It's encircled by landmarks like the Burj Khalifa and Downtown Dubai. Residents at Damac Altitude Apartments' enjoy easy access to leisure spots like City Walk and Jumeirah Beach, and proximity to essential amenities including The Dubai Mall, healthcare centers, schools, and hotels. Plus, it's just a 20-minute drive from Dubai International Airport.","price":1180000,"title":"Altitude de GRISOGONO","bitrix":{"id":326,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Altitude","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Altitude","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/altitude_feature_1_7091de9c6e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/altitude_feature_1_7091de9c6e.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.184242,"lng":55.27243},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.